{"4370750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dig Till You Die", "steam_appid": 4370750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>Roguelite Survivor game</strong>, venture ever deeper throughout the levels to extract all the treasure, which will make you stronger in order to survive against waves of enemies growing even more powerful the more you still stand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370750/extras/a90e7e8e1a688ec60b226fd36b2624b0.poster.avif?t=1783086269\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370750/extras/a90e7e8e1a688ec60b226fd36b2624b0.webm?t=1783086269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370750/extras/a90e7e8e1a688ec60b226fd36b2624b0.mp4?t=1783086269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>USE YOUR DRONES TO MINE RESSOURCES</u></strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your trusty <strong>drones</strong>, mine all you can to extract nearby available resources. Upgrade them to face this incredibly hostile yet treasure-filled environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370750/extras/4e7eb2896ad7e827d09abf6951567707.poster.avif?t=1783086269\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370750/extras/4e7eb2896ad7e827d09abf6951567707.webm?t=1783086269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370750/extras/4e7eb2896ad7e827d09abf6951567707.mp4?t=1783086269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UPGRADE YOUR CHARACTER</u></strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you survive, you have many options at your disposal. Experiment, discover, combine, and optimize new loadouts each game by: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Getting new <strong>weapons</strong>, each offering a unique way to protect yourself against your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Spending your hard-earned Gold at Power <strong>Shrines</strong>, offering you <strong>stat upgrades</strong> whose power depends on whom that altar belonged to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gathering <strong>items</strong> with new abilities, hidden within chests placed all around each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Leveling up</strong> with experience points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370750/extras/98a31f36de5ed57be88767eaf89bf78d.poster.avif?t=1783086269\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370750/extras/98a31f36de5ed57be88767eaf89bf78d.webm?t=1783086269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370750/extras/98a31f36de5ed57be88767eaf89bf78d.mp4?t=1783086269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>Roguelite Survivor game</strong>, venture ever deeper throughout the levels to extract all the treasure, which will make you stronger in order to survive against waves of enemies growing even more powerful the more you still stand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" a